---
description: Prepare one replanAssignments evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: VolunteerBriefing[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Process withdrawals and changed mission conditions by identifying exact capability gaps. Propose replacement teams or reduced scope, seek fresh consent for changed roles, and cancel unsafe or incomplete deployments rather than pretending nominal headcount is sufficient. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
